    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "b"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "b",
        "fadetime": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-300,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "focus": "l",
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please wait, General!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are too impatient.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But General! The Duke's envoy was almost ready to spit on\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did we get what we wanted?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We got partial usage rights for the industrial area and the right to cross the border... but did it have to be so humiliating?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Victorian dukes have you at their beck and call, treating us Sarkaz like tamed beasts. This is not what our soldiers redeployed from the civil war were promised, General!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this not all that we desired?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you would prefer the Victorians treat the Sarkaz as their greatest enemy from the beginning, banding together to face us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. I know it's necessary for our enemies to think us weak, but this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many within our ranks feel this is terribly dishonorable\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I promise them honor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do the Sarkaz have honor in the eyes of the Victorians?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have been far too impetuous lately, Manfred.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dignity is of high import.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "You fight for the rights of your men, and thus do people respect you. Were these ordinary times, perhaps I too would commend you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But do you remember what we are here to do? We are preparing to steal the heart of a nation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "To bring the greatest empire on this great land to its knees.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their prejudices have left them weak, and the Sarkaz are in hunger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "What we truly need is neither honor nor respect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are our men prepared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ready to depart at a moment's notice. Our people sent in advance to Londinium will support us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "The final deadline for our arrival as dictated by the Duke of Cavendish's request is fast approaching. We can set out at any time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we march to destroy Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
