    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the guards leave, Manfred takes out a wine glass he had placed to the side."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openwindow",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowstormflp",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "sn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Care for a drink?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "sn",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You never drank before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the General has ordered me to learn Victorian 'etiquette', all preparation for our upcoming duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have learnt rather recently that those nobles pair every meal with multiple kinds of wine, each requiring its own unique glass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember when we were young and the General led us to an ancient battlefield for swordplay? The night was cold, and only after the General made some soup did we realize we had nothing to hold it in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thankfully, the battlefield was nothing short of spent shells, and you used those to fashion four cups.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, me, the General, and Her Highness, carrying cups made out of shell casings while sitting in front of the fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember. It was a peaceful night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like this one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The frigid moonlight of late winter falls through the window. Manfred rests his hand upon his sword hilt that was equally as cold."
    },
    {
        "text": "The air is still, and the two of them can hear the other's heartbeat."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "You're going to Londinium tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you wished to see the General.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you couldn't. Otherwise, you wouldn't have come to see me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I found that when I caught a glimpse of him from a distance, the first thought that came to my mind was that I should kill him, there and then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you should applaud yourself for maintaining some reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "And so you decided to come to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard you've improved your swordsmanship. Why don't we see for ourselves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been able to best you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't beg for mercy before you've even fallen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was the one time we fought in Her Highness's study.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "We knocked down an entire bookshelf, and the General took our weapons away and made us tidy up the room within thirty minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew that you did it on purpose, wanting attention from Their Highnesses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1"
    },
    {
