        "duration": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Another blink, and Manfred feels a chill running across the side of his neck."
    },
    {
        "text": "He didn't have the time to draw his sword and fight back. He didn't have the time to even think about fighting back."
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps he was too tired?"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I cut your neck here, at least there will be no need for you to die in Londinium. I can just throw your corpse into the furnace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "It would spare many from dying on a distant battlefield in a foreign land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you've made your decision, then kill me here. It will be your final chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've made yours, I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The General says you lack conviction, but I don't think he is entirely correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "You shouldn't speak so much when someone has your life in her hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is only recently that I've realized I'm not as resolute as you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have been brought to where we are by the invisible tides of fate, but ever since the day this war started... There is no going back for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Manfred"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then do your best to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't hold back next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_wind",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_darkmagic",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "action": "zoom",
        "poszoom": "0.5,0.5",
        "scale": 0.95,
        "focus": "none",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
