    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island of Babel, Kazdel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#2$1",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "A cold wind scatters the thick clouds of late winter, allowing sunlight to peek through the gaps and spread out across the bridge of the ship."
    },
    {
        "text": "Down the stairs, Ascalon stands unmoving by a guardrail."
    },
    {
        "text": "She shuts her eyes tight, enjoying the fleeting warmth of the sunshine."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothtrailground",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Above the stairs, there is a clear rustling of cloth dragging against the ground."
    },
    {
        "text": "A shadow flit across the assassin's face, blocking out the rays of sunlight."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$wasteland_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "-200,-20",
        "posto": "0,-20",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry Ascalon, did I disturb your rest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I wouldn't make any sound, if I took off my shoes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. You are welcome at any time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ground's cold. You should put your shoes back on, Your Highness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-20",
        "posto": "0,-28",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "c"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-28",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing you wish to tell me, Ascalon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reason you returned to Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It was my own decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you wouldn't agree, and I didn't know how to bring it up with Your Highness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would I not agree, Ascalon? Since it was your decision, I would trust your judgement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you manage to see them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Manfred and Theresis are both well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can believe that. They're strong men.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should finish our preparations soon as well. The operation to retake Kazdel isn't too far off now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why does your brow seem even more furrowed than before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our recent combat plans have been radical, and they've won us some battles too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still, I've been feeling uneasy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babel has changed a lot, especially...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor has changed a lot too... become more efficient, more clinical. It's like... the Doctor's now a machine that never makes mistakes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's just what a commander should be, no? Why would that make you worry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got an incredible commander now, sure... But I think I trust the weirdo who kept falling off a burdenbeast more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is now really the best time to attack Kazdel, Your Highness?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your intuition has always been on the mark.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've had your worries too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've faced countless insurmountable odds over the years, but we've overcome them all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe that we can go through what comes next as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've always been in danger, yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babel carries the hopes of many, Ascalon. Faith has gotten us this far, and we cannot stop now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have always been at a disadvantage against the Military Commission. Now, most of their forces have redeployed to Londinium. It is a one-of-a-kind opportunity. We have no choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will be at your side, keeping you safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Ascalon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the future, you must go further afield, to protect others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax for now, and bask in the sunlight for a moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Highness...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right, remember to not always rest on your feet. If you're tired, you should go and enjoy a nice nap in your room.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 2,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "The sunlight shines upon Ascalon's face once more."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is bright and warm. But the moment the shadow faded away, she suddenly felt some peculiar emotion flooding through her chest."
    },
    {
        "text": "At the time, she was unable to describe what it was. It dawned on her many years later, on another sunny day."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was an unwillingness to part ways."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
